SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE
=====================

This licence covers exactly one file: `bin/vault-verify.js`.

The rest of the repository is proprietary; see LICENSE.

The carve-out is deliberate and is described in LICENSE. In short: Vault claims
a customer can prove their ledger is intact without trusting the vendor, and a
proprietary verification tool would make that claim circular. This file imports
nothing from `src/`, so it can be copied out and run on its own against any
Vault export, by anyone.

